(text "The console end of key-c, as console-a has it:\n- VKEY comes through U2: 80 mA limit, reverse blocking, discharged\n  when off. Never straight from a GPIO. EN pulled up: on by default.\n- CC1 and CC2 read on their own ADC1 pins (D5, D6). Plugged straight\n  in, a key shows 5.1k on both.\n- 2.2k pull-ups to VKEY, so a key that's off isn't powered through SDA/SCL.\n- U3/U4 rails on 3V3: the CC pull-ups can't feed VKEY." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 147.32 106.68 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "dac15db1-3a90-4563-806e-94109b6a1a45"))
